<title>USA: Friedman rejoins CIBC Wood Gundy.</title>
<headline>Friedman rejoins CIBC Wood Gundy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy said Pamela Friedman has rejoined the firm and will work in the merchant banking arm.</p>
<p>From 1991 to early 1996 Friedman was a director and senior lender in the media and telecommunications groups at CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p>Friedman was employed from January, 1996 through May at Wasserstein Perella Securities Inc, where she specialized in media industry mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>Wasserstein Perella declined comment.</p>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy is a unit of Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce.</p>
